#: templates/pages/about.html:38
msgid ""
"A gentle corner hidden amidst the city's hustle and bustle. We don't just "
"sell books, we create a space where people meet inspiration. This is a haven "
"for independent thoughts and a birthplace for warm artistry."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/about.html:38
msgid ""
"Step into the reading room, and the essence of art naturally weaves itself "
"into your literary experience. This is not just a temple of knowledge; it is "
"also an exhibition space for local artists—paintings adorning the walls, "
"sculptures scattered among the bookshelves, and unexpected art installations "
"around the corners,all silently speaking the language of beauty. In the "
"pauses between turning pages, a simple glance upward may lead you to an "
"artwork that touches your heart."
msgstr ""

#: templates/pages/about.html:41
msgid ""
"Here, the ritual of reading is carefully nurtured. We have specially "
"prepared handcrafted bookplates, beautifully bound special edition books, "
"and thoughtfully designed stationery, each item carrying the warmth and "
"intention of its maker. Once you've chosen your beloved book, consider "
"ordering a cup of fair trade coffee or organic tea at the bar. In the midst "
"of the fragrant atmosphere, let the words and your thoughts gradually "
"intertwine."
msgstr ""

